  "content": "# 第34题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n34. What can we infer from this passage？\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. It is crucial to improve the definition of time．\n\nB. B. A fixed frame will make time meaningless．\n\nC. C. We should live in harmony with nature．\n\nD. D. History is a mirror reflecting reality．\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nC\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查被动语态。主语the book与谓语write是被动关系，且‘去年’是一般过去时，故用was written。"
